ind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #01 | 97 Blocks, a New Sea and Dungeon Puzzles","summary":"Hello Islanders!Welcome to the first DriftyLands devlog! The demo has been on Steam since October 19, and the game launches in Early Access on October 30. We haven't been sitting still since the demo came out: building got a complete overhaul, the sea was rebuilt, the dungeons got puzzles, and the whole game can now be played with a gamepad.If you run into a problem, write to us on our Steam discussions page: steamcommunity.com/app/5195430/discussions We read every message!Now, on to what's new:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T10:27:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039331","verified_at":"2026-10-24T14:40:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5195430-1846651706687329","game_id":"steam-5195430","kind":"announcement","title":"Your Island Awaits: The DriftyLands Demo Hits Steam on October 19","summary":"The DriftyLands demo arrives on Steam on October 19!Buy an island, clear it, automate it, then find the hole underneath. In the free demo, play solo or with up to three friends: gather, craft, build machines and head down into the dungeon below the island.What's Waiting for You?You start on a small island. The workshop where you chop trees and mine ore soon fills up with machines and turns into a factory that runs itself.Gather and craft: Chop trees, mine ore, go fishing. Make your own tools and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T16:03:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687329","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:16:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5195430":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:28:48Z","status":"ok","all_